																	<div class="cont">
										<div class="breadcramp float-l"><p>You are here:</p><span><a href="http://heliosage.com">Home</a><img src="http://heliosage.com/wp-content/themes/felis/images/breadcramp-arr.gif" class="separator" alt="" /><a href="http://heliosage.com/solar-resources/">Solar Resources</a><img src="http://heliosage.com/wp-content/themes/felis/images/breadcramp-arr.gif" class="separator" alt="" />Why Solar?</span></div>																			</div>
																<div id="head"><img src="http://heliosage.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/07/solar-resources.png" width="980" height="156" class="attachment-sg_slider2" alt="solar-resources" title="solar-resources" /></div>							</div>
