				</ul>
		</div><div id="df-text" class="widget_text col1-2"><h4>HelioSage Mission<img src="http://heliosage.com/wp-content/themes/felis/images/heading-bg-footer.gif" alt=""></h4>			<div class="textwidget"><p>HelioSage provides solutions covering every aspect of commercial and utility scale solar project development, including design, installation, financing, and consulting. We’ve worked with schools, municipalities, Fortune 500 companies and utilities to unlock the value of solar electricity. Our goal is simple: deliver the many benefits of solar power to our clients. <A href="http://dev.heliosage.com/solar-resources/why-solar/">Find out how HelioSage can help your organization go solar.</a></p>
